# to compose the already-registered mm2_haltedAt_computable/
# progOf_computable instances (now upstream, in
# Undecidability.MinskyMachines.Util.MM2_simulator) across a file
# boundary; confirmed this genuinely fails both via `extract` and via
# plain `typeclasses eauto` (not just an ordering/import fix -- a real
# MetaRocq cross-file extraction-composition limitation, same class of
# issue documented in MM2_simulator.v's own header, but this time with
# no colocation fix available since semidec_of_MM2 itself is CKA-project-
# local, not something to also move upstream). Fixing this properly
# would mean re-deriving the ~150-line extraction chain
# (mm2_atom_fun_computable through mm2_haltedAt_computable) a second
# time, locally, purely to satisfy this one non-critical-path file --
# flagged to Jeremy rather than done unilaterally.
# MM2/Legacy/EffectiveInseparability_MM2_Race.v
# MM2/Legacy/SMN_MM2.v

